<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league summaries</p>
<p>on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Coventry 2 (Huckerby 6, McAllister 31) Newcastle 1 (Shearer</p>
<p>61). Halftime 2-0. Attendance: 21,538</p>
<p>Liverpool 4 (Collymore 6, 63, Fowler 27, Lyttle 51 own goal)</p>
<p>Nottingham Forest 2 (Campbell 34, Pearce 60). Halftime 2-1.</p>
<p>Attendance: 36,126</p>
